/** Trinity Menu File "eventDef"

This class represents objects that are parsed from "eventDef" entries
defined in our menu system. It was designed for Nuclide.

They are used to define entry points for 'events' to trigger
interface specific actions.

# See also

[menuDef](@ref vguiScriptedItem)
[itemDef](@ref vguiScriptedMenu)

*/
class
ncScriptedEvent
{
    void ncScriptedEvent(void);
};

void
ncScriptedEvent::ncScriptedEvent(void)
{

}
